    "summary": "Bearer: an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES TERMINATOR CAPTAIN** model.\n\nOnce per battle round for your whole army, you can use the **[Rapid Ingress](vsdata:ability/core.rapid-ingress)** or **[Heroic Intervention](vsdata:ability/core.heroic-intervention)** Stratagem on the bearer's unit even if that Stratagem has already been used in the same phase. If you do so:\n\n- that use costs 1CP less\n- that use does not stop other units from being targeted by that Stratagem in the same phase",
